WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.899
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Diagnostic Lab ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:10.108
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:10.108 --> 00:00:18.691
Lab ka kaam test catalogue se shuru hota hai, phir order, sample, result, aur ant mein ek printable report.

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:20.054
Test Catalogue.

00:00:20.054 --> 00:00:35.142
Har test ka naam, category jaise Kidney, Diabetes ya Thyroid, sample ka type, price, T A T yaani report kitne ghante mein, aur reference range, jaise Fasting Blood Sugar ke liye sattar se sau milligram per decilitre.

00:00:35.142 --> 00:00:42.617
Kyun? Kyunki reference range pehle se likhi ho to result likhte hi app bata deta hai ki normal hai ya nahi.

00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:52.510
Packages ya Profiles tab mein kai tests ka ek package, jaise Diabetes Profile ya Full Body Checkup, ek discounted price par.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:52.874
Kyun?

00:00:52.874 --> 00:01:00.507
Kyunki patient ko ek ek test chunne ki jagah ek package aasan lagta hai, aur lab ki bikri bhi badhti hai.

00:01:00.878 --> 00:01:04.578
Naya order. Patient ka naam, mobile aur umar.

00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:14.525
Collection chuno: Walk-in, yaani patient lab aaya, ya Home collection, jisme address aur preferred time slot likhte hain.

00:01:14.525 --> 00:01:19.129
Hum Home collection chunte hain aur address likhte hain.

00:01:19.506 --> 00:01:27.378
Ab tests. Packages aur individual tests ke checkbox hain. Diabetes Profile aur Fever Panel chunte hain.

00:01:27.378 --> 00:01:31.505
Neeche total apne aap. Create order dabate hain. Kyun?

00:01:31.505 --> 00:01:40.677
Kyunki test chunne mein galti se koi test chhoot jaye to patient dobara aata hai, aur checkbox se ye galti kam hoti hai.

00:01:41.053 --> 00:01:47.674
Order ban gaya. Ye order ka page hai: patient, home collection ka address, aur status Booked.

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:55.363
Status ek ke baad ek badalta hai: Sample collected, Received at lab, Processing, Report ready aur Delivered.

00:01:55.363 --> 00:01:57.855
Mark as button se agla stage. Kyun?

00:01:57.855 --> 00:02:05.544
Kyunki patient phone karke poochta hai mera report kahan tak pahuncha, aur status se turant jawab milta hai.

00:02:05.914 --> 00:02:15.762
Orders list mein upar tab hain: All, Booked, Sample collected, Received at lab, Processing, Report ready, Delivered aur Cancelled.

00:02:15.762 --> 00:02:20.610
Har order ke saamne uska type, Home ya Walk-in, aur samay. Kyun?

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:27.125
Kyunki lab ke staff ko roz dekhna hota hai ki kaunsa order kis stage par atka hua hai.

00:02:28.218 --> 00:02:32.430
Ab result likhna. Processing wale order Neha Singh ko kholte hain.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:36.131
Har test ke saamne Result ka box aur uski reference range.

00:02:36.131 --> 00:02:40.087
Fasting Blood Sugar mein ek sau chaudah likhte hain, aur Save.

00:02:40.087 --> 00:02:43.533
App ne turant bata diya ki ye range se upar hai. Kyun?

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:49.149
Kyunki result ko galat padhna sabse khatarnak galti hai, aur ye alert us se bachata hai.

00:02:49.515 --> 00:02:56.026
Baaki tests ke result bhi isi tarah bharte hain. Sab bhar jaane par status Report ready karte hain.

00:02:56.026 --> 00:03:07.798
View or print report dabate hi patient ki printable report khulti hai: lab ka naam, patient ki details, har test ka result aur range, aur jo range se bahar hai wo alag dikhta hai.

00:03:07.798 --> 00:03:14.966
Ye report PDF ya WhatsApp par bhi ja sakti hai. Kyun? Kyunki patient ko kaagaz bhi chahiye aur phone par bhi.

00:03:15.344 --> 00:03:21.895
Aur bill. Order ke page par Generate invoice dabate hi tests ke amount ka GST invoice ban jata hai.

00:03:21.895 --> 00:03:26.395
Isse lab ka hisaab bhi saaf rehta hai aur patient ko bill milta hai.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:38.996
Dashboard par Pending orders dikhte hain, aur aaj ki home collections, kis patient ke ghar kis samay jana hai, jaise Meera More ka saat se nau baje ka slot.

00:03:38.996 --> 00:03:43.831
Kyun? Kyunki home collection wale staff ko din ka route yahin se milta hai.

00:03:44.195 --> 00:03:57.893
Aaj humne Lab ka flow dekha: test catalogue reference range ke saath, packages, order home collection ke saath, status ke stage, result aur normal ya abnormal alert, printable report, aur invoice.

00:03:57.893 --> 00:04:02.296
Ek practical baat: sample collected ka status turant mark karo.

00:04:02.296 --> 00:04:08.166
Isse patient ko hamesha sahi update milta hai aur staff ki zimmedari saaf rehti hai.
